  "question": {
    "text": "The time-period of a simple pendulum of length <math><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>m</mn></math> suspended in a car moving with uniform acceleration of <math><mn>5</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>m&nbsp;</mn><msup><mrow><mn>s</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> in a horizontal straight road is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>m&nbsp;</mn><msup><mrow><mn>s</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>"
